## 📁 Project Structure

```
face-attendance-system/
├── client/                  # React frontend
│   └── src/
├── server/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── face_engine/     # DeepFace recognition logic
│   │   ├── mlops/           # MLflow tracking + drift monitoring
│   │   ├── models/
│   │   └── routes/          # Flask blueprints (auth, students, classes, attendance, face)
│   ├── app.py                # Entry point
│   └── requirements.txt
```